00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:46,000
The Hunt is a action, thriller, horror film directed by Craig Zobel.

3
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Twelve strangers wake up in a clearing.

4
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:26,000
They don't know where they are—or how they got there.

5
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:46,000
In the shadow of a dark internet conspiracy theory, ruthless elitists
gather at a remote location to hunt humans for sport.

6
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
But their master plan is about to be derailed when one of
the hunted turns the tables on her pursuers.

7
